          "snippet": {
            "line": 905,
            "text": "theorem density_chart {h : ℝ} (hh : 0 < h) (hh1 : h < 1 / 2)\n    (n i : ℕ) {a b : ℝ} (hab : a < b) {z : PressureStream.Lift Plane} (hz : 0 < z.2.1.1) :\n    density a b hab (qLength (2 * h)) (physicalToChartTZ h n i z) =\n      (chartScale n)⁻¹ * density a b hab (qLength (2 * h)) z"
          }
